<title>USA: Mellon Bank files shelf $500 mln preferred.</title>
<headline>Mellon Bank files shelf $500 mln preferred.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mellon Bank Corp filed a shelf registration on Thursday with the Securities and Exchange Commission for up to $500 million in cumulative trust preferred securities.</p>
<p>The offering will be made by Mellon Capital I, a business trust unit of the bank holding company.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be invested in junior subordinated debentures of Mellon Bank, which will use funds for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
